d Ṭhākur"},"title":["Siddhi-Lālasā"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["kobe gaura-vane,    suradhunī-taṭe,","    ‘hā rādhe hā kṛṣṇa’ bo’le","kāṅdiyā beḍābo,    deho-sukha chāḍi’,","    nānā latā-taru-tole"],"translation":["O when, O when will this soul chant in Gaura-forest on the Ganges banks the Holy Names “Rādhā,” and “Krishna” renouncing all the body’s joys and drenched with all the tears I’ve wept amidst the herbs, beneath a tree."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["śva-pacha-gṛhete,    māgiyā khāibo,","    pibo sarasvatī-jala","puline puline    gaḍā-gaḍi dibo,","    kori’ kṛṣṇa-kolāholo"],"translation":["When, at some outcaste’s home shall I give up all thoughts of caste and beg to share with him humble *prasādam* and drink the water of the Saraswatī? Along the banks, my voice choked with my ecstasy I’ll chant “Krishna” in great delight."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["dhāma-vāsī jane,    praṇati koriyā,","    māgibo kṛpāra leśa","vaiṣṇava-charaṇa-    reṇu gāya mākhi,","    dhari’ avadhūta-veśa"],"translation":["And when will I bow down before a resident of the holy *dhām* and beg from him a drop of mercy; when Oh when will I smear my body with dust from a Vaiṣṇava’s holy feet and wear the mendicant’s cloth?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["gauḍa-vraja-bane,    bheda nā heribo,","    hoibo varaja-vāsī","dhāmera svarūpa,    sphuribe nayane,","    hoibo rādhāra dāsī"],"translation":["Then I shall see no difference between the forest of Gauḍa and Vraja, and I will be transformed into a resident of the *dhām*. The true nature of the Lord’s abode will manifest itself to my eyes, and I will become a maidservant of Śrīmatī Rādhārāṇī."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/46-kabe-gaura-vane","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/kabe-gora-vane","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Sudarshan Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sudarshan-prabhu-siddhi-lalasa","personSlug":"sudarshan-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/kobe-gaura-vane-suradhuni-tate/","description":"Siddhi-Lālasā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Siddhi-Lālasā. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"kobe-gaura-vane-suradhuni-tate"}}